<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Phileo Allied H1 net down 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Phileo Allied H1 net down 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31</p>
<p>		    (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 19.38     vs	  26.0</p>
<p>    Shr	   (cents)    17.0	vs	  22.8</p>
<p>    Operating revenue     202.34     vs	 100.70</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   33.55     vs	  33.12</p>
<p>    Minorities (000)less    8.0	vs  less  46.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The full name of the company is Phileo Allied Bhd. It is involved in financial services.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
